<title>INDONESIA: Indonesia Indosat says nine-mth net up.</title>
<headline>Indonesia Indosat says nine-mth net up.</headline>
<dateline>JAKARTA 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nine months to September 30</p>
<p>			 (in billion rupiah unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net income			 361.6 vs 342.9</p>
<p>Earnings per share (rupiah)  348.7 vs 330.8</p>
<p>Note: The consolidated results were unaudited. PT Indonesian Satellite Corporation (Indosat) is a telecommunication firm.</p>
<p>-- Jakarta newsroom +6221 384-6364</p>
</text>
